        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omumwaka ogwa kabiri bamazire okuhika Yerusaalemu ha Nju ya MUKAMA, omukwezi kwakabiri Zerubbabbeeri mutabani wa Seralityeri, na Yeswa mutabani wa Yozadaki, nubwo baatandikire hamu n'abandi abasigaireho hali bagenzi baabo, banyakatagara, Abaleevi naabo boona abaarugire omubunyagwa baija Yerusaalemu. Bakakoma Abaleevi okurugirra ha b'emyaaka abiri ey'obukuru n'okweyongerayo, nubo barolerre omulimo ogw'okwombeka Enju ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeswa hamu na batabani be n'ab'oruganda rwe, Kadumyeri na batabani be, batabani ba Yuda, bakatandika okurolerra abantu abaakoraga omunju ya Ruhanga, nibakonyerwa batabani ba Henadaadi n'Abaleevi, batabani baabu n'ab'oruganda rwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
